"talkIds":[7905301],"talks":[{"talkId":7905301,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","beginCond":[{"param":["7905301","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_AND","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7905301,"initDialog":790530101,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[13247],"performCfg":"","priority":5,"questId":79053,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":790530101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13247,"speakerName":"Idyia","textMapHash":4001819626,"text":"\"Welcome to the Veluriyam Mirage. I hope you can relax and enjoy some respite from your tiring journey.\"","nextNodeIds":[790530102]},{"nodeId":790530102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13247,"speakerName":"Idyia","textMapHash":392337602,"text":"That's how I would have greeted you if things had been different... *sigh* It's hard to believe how much has happened.","nextNodeIds":[790530103]},{"nodeId":790530103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13247,"speakerName":"Idyia","textMapHash":4021288474,"text":"Since everything's fixed now, I thought... Better late than never. What do you think? Pretty professional, huh?","nextNodeIds":[790530104,790530109,790530114,790530117]},{"nodeId":790530104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2161659578,"text":"About Preprints...","nextNodeIds":[790530105]},{"nodeId":790530105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13247,"speakerName":"Idyia","textMapHash":3011470242,"text":"Uh... do you want me to explain the underlying theory? I don't actually know that much about it. In short, a Preprint is like an idea...","nextNodeIds":[790530106]},{"nodeId":790530106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13247,"speakerName":"Idyia","textMapHash":4168693066,"text":"Think of it like how a plant should grow is imprinted in its seed, or how a bird will spread its wings is determined while it's still in its egg.","nextNodeIds":[790530107]},{"nodeId":790530107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13247,"speakerName":"Idyia","textMapHash":821230122,"text":"Things follow these instincts and rules that are programmed into them and become that which we see around us. Perhaps the blueprints of all things were created at the very beginning.","nextNodeIds":[790530108]},{"nodeId":790530108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13247,"speakerName":"Idyia","textMapHash":3216238282,"text":"A Preprint is like those blueprints, and the light reflected through the bottle transforms them into the entire Veluriyam Mirage. Ah, but this kind of magic only works within the confines of the bottle.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":790530109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1625918202,"text":"About Oceanids...","nextNodeIds":[790530110]},{"nodeId":790530110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13247,"speakerName":"Idyia","textMapHash":750332322,"text":"Oh, are you wondering why we fled Fontaine? It feels like it happened a lifetime ago...","nextNodeIds":[790530111]},{"nodeId":790530111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13247,"speakerName":"Idyia","textMapHash":1879794146,"text":"The reason for our flight... it would be the \"water\". The waters of Fontaine changed, and to the Oceanids, now the waters there are full of... pain and hatred...?","nextNodeIds":[790530112]},{"nodeId":790530112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13247,"speakerName":"Idyia","textMapHash":1256798770,"text":"For us, if we wanted to live, fleeing was the best choice. Oh, it was then that became lost and fainted in the desert...","nextNodeIds":[790530113]},{"nodeId":790530113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13247,"speakerName":"Idyia","textMapHash":3288607402,"text":"I must say, this desert is really just too vast!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":790530114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1639431770,"text":"About Rhodeia...","nextNodeIds":[790530115]},{"nodeId":790530115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13247,"speakerName":"Idyia","textMapHash":3485998154,"text":"Huh, Rhodeia? Have you met her?","nextNodeIds":[790530116]},{"nodeId":790530116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13247,"speakerName":"Idyia","textMapHash":41115314,"text":"Looks like she finally found a place for herself... Qingce Village? Is that in Liyue? You really have gone far away, Rhodeia...","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":790530117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1099875890,"text":"Keep up the good work!","nextNodeIds":[790530118]},{"nodeId":790530118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13247,"speakerName":"Idyia","textMapHash":2502182938,"text":"Yeah, I will... I will work hard! And please do enjoy the humid environment here. You'll rarely come across such a place in the desert!","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7905301,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}},{"subQuestId":7905302,"order":2,"stepDescription":"","stepDescTextMapHash":0,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7905313,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[7905313],"talks":[{"talkId":7905313,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","beginCond":[{"param":["7905302","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["120310","1","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_PACK_HAVE_ITEM"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_AND","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7905313,"initDialog":790531301,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[13247],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Penumbra_79041/Q7905313","priority":10,"questId":79053,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":790531301,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":913117202,"text":"Idyia! Emergency, huge news!","nextNodeIds":[790531302]},{"nodeId":790531302,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3518266586,"text":"We found a pocket watch! Look! Is this the legendary Mora Pocketwatch!?","nextNodeIds":[790531303,790531304]},{"nodeId":790531303,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2704620106,"text":"It's gold and shiny on the outside!","nextNodeIds":[790531305]},{"nodeId":790531305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13247,"speakerName":"Idyia","textMapHash":38635242,"text":"Hmm, let me take a look...","nextNodeIds":[790531306]},{"nodeId":790531306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13247,"speakerName":"Idyia","textMapHash":3097825514,"text":"Y-You really found it!? Is this ordained by destiny?","nextNodeIds":[790531307]},{"nodeId":790531307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13247,"speakerName":"Idyia","textMapHash":1286772954,"text":"The ultimate prize left by the mysterious adventurer was found by the legendary Traveler...","nextNodeIds":[790531308]},{"nodeId":790531308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13247,"speakerName":"Idyia","textMapHash":2249764058,"text":"I sense some sort of... spiritual legacy!","nextNodeIds":[790531309]},{"nodeId":790531309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":41672506,"text":"Paimon is really happy to be praised like that, but Paimon is more curious about what happens next...","nextNodeIds":[790531310,790531311]},{"nodeId":790531310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2017207930,"text":"Will we get additional rewards?","nextNodeIds":[790531312]},{"nodeId":790531312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13247,"speakerName":"Idyia","textMapHash":3593887002,"text":"N-Nothing like that...","nextNodeIds":[790531313]},{"nodeId":790531313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13247,"speakerName":"Idyia","textMapHash":2487112714,"text":"Actually, it never occurred to me that someone would find this pocket watch... After all, even I forgot where it was buried.","nextNodeIds":[790531314]},{"nodeId":790531314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13247,"speakerName":"Idyia","textMapHash":1927118466,"text":"But it's valuable on its own, right? Right!? Additional rewards from me are unnecessary...","nextNodeIds":[790531315]},{"nodeId":790531315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13247,"speakerName":"Idyia","textMapHash":1615631402,"text":"Anyway, I'll be writing this down, with just the right amount of flair, of course. I'll transform it into an exciting and thrilling story for my future guests.","nextNodeIds":[790531316]},{"nodeId":790531316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13247,"speakerName":"Idyia","textMapHash":3608651818,"text":"Now, the treasure you buried will be replacing this Mora Pocketwatch!","nextNodeIds":[790531317]},{"nodeId":790531317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1278624282,"text":"Oh yeah, that's right! We talked about that too, it's about the stories hidden inside the treasure.","nextNodeIds":[790531318]},{"nodeId":790531318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2808818202,"text":"#Anyway, let's study this watch a little longer, {NICKNAME}!","nextNodeIds":[790531319]},{"nodeId":790531319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3155235338,"text":"Idyia, please write a really exciting story about us!","nextNodeIds":[790531320]},{"nodeId":790531320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13247,"speakerName":"Idyia","textMapHash":3603752322,"text":"Don't worry, leave it to me!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":790531311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1199932170,"text":"Will it trigger a hidden event?","nextNodeIds":[790531312]},{"nodeId":790531304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3207606986,"text":"It has Mora engraved on it!","nextNodeIds":[790531305]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7905313,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"